{
  "id": "3e7e3654b0a4",
  "title": "Solid Queue 1.6.0 now supports fiber workers",
  "originalTitle": "Solid Queue 1.6.0 now supports fiber workers",
  "source": "Hacker News",
  "category": "Tech",
  "url": "https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/releases/tag/v1.6.0",
  "publishedAt": "2026-08-01T07:42:08.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><p>A long-awaited feature thanks to <a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/crmne/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/crmne\">@crmne</a> on this release: instead of using a thread pool to run jobs in multiple threads per works, you can now use <a href=\"https://docs.ruby-lang.org/en/master/Fiber.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">fibers</a> on a single fiber reactor thread. To use this, you just need to specify the number of fibers instead of the number of threads in your worker configuration, like this:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"workers: - queues: &quot;api*&quot; fibers: 100 polling_interval: 0.05\"><pre><span>workers</span>: - <span>queues</span>: <span><span>\"</span>api*<span>\"</span></span> <span>fibers</span>: <span>100</span> <span>polling_interval</span>: <span>0.05</span></pre></div>\n<p>It uses <a href=\"https://github.com/socketry/async\">Async</a> under the hood, so you need to have that as a dependency for it to work. Also, you need to be using fiber isolation in Rails (<code>config.active_support.isolation_level`` = :fiber</code>).</p>\n<p>This can be very useful for I/O-bound workloads, such as those involving LLM calls.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add fiber worker execution mode by <a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/crmne/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/crmne\">@crmne</a> in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4205013353\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/issues/728\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rails/solid_queue/pull/728/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/pull/728\">#728</a></li>\n<li>Roll back transactions leaked by killed job threads in tests by <a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rosa/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rosa\">@rosa</a> in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5018029481\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/issues/773\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rails/solid_queue/pull/773/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/pull/773\">#773</a></li>\n<li>Document how to update dynamic recurring tasks by <a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/wintan1418/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/wintan1418\">@wintan1418</a> in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5019703174\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/issues/777\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rails/solid_queue/pull/777/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/pull/777\">#777</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/crmne/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/crmne\">@crmne</a> made their first contribution in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4205013353\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/issues/728\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rails/solid_queue/pull/728/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/pull/728\">#728</a></li>\n<li><a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/wintan1418/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/wintan1418\">@wintan1418</a> made their first contribution in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5019703174\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/issues/777\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rails/solid_queue/pull/777/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/pull/777\">#777</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/rails/solid_queue/compare/v1.5.1...v1.6.0\"><tt>v1.5.1...v1.6.0</tt></a></p></div></div>",
